# Cloudflare Pages headers. Cross-origin isolation lets the in-browser Kokoro voices
# (demos/shared/kokoro-browser.js) use multi-threaded WebAssembly -- about 2x faster than
# single-threaded. "credentialless" keeps the CDN scripts, models and API calls working.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
